#org @TwoIsland_JoyfulGameCorner_Text_YouRescuedLostelle
[BLUE]So you rescued [GREEN]Lostelle?[BLUE]\nHow can I thank you?\p[GREEN]Lostelle[BLUE], darling, forgive me!\pDaddy didn't know you were scared\nand in trouble!

#org @TwoIsland_JoyfulGameCorner_Text_LostelleItsOkayDaddy
[GREEN]Lostelle:[RED] It's okay, Daddy.\nI got to be friends with [GREEN][PLAYER]![RED]

#org @gText_twoislandgcguy_Msgone
Hey, but listen! I'm begging you,\nyou have to go to Three Island.\pIf anything were to happen to my\n[GREEN]Lostelle[.]\p[BLUE]My place is the house with the red\nroof on Three Island.\pShe may just show up late here,\nso I can't run off anywhere.\pThat's why I have to get you to do\nme this big favor.

#org @gText_twoislandgcguy_GText_MsgTwo
Thank you for saving [GREEN]Lostelle!\p[BLUE]Hm, there's a Mew in the forest\nthat ran away?\pI'm sure if you brought a Pok\e-\nmon like [GREEN]Mewtwo[BLUE] to [GREEN]Berry Forest,[BLUE]\lit could track it down[.]

#org @gText_twoislandgcguy_GText_MsgThree
Oh?! Did you catch the [GREEN]Mew!\p[BLUE]That's amazing [GREEN][PLAYER]![BLUE]

